                "question": "What facilities are available on the campus?",
                "answer": "The campus has smart classrooms, science laboratories, a library, a sports ground and a computer lab."
              },
              {
                "question": "Do you offer transportation services?",
                "answer": "Yes, the school offers transportation. Contact the school for details."
              },
